# Weather API

> Reverse-engineered internal API. Unofficial — may change without notice.

## Documentation Index
- `SKILL.md` (this file)
- `references/REFERENCE.md` (detailed endpoint docs)
- `references/ENDPOINTS.json` (machine-readable endpoint catalog)
- `scripts/api.ts` (typed client interface)

## Authentication
Custom Header (x-mp-key) — Authentication method detected from captured traffic.

### Providing credentials
- Prefer passing auth as request headers or cookies at call time (do not hardcode secrets into the skill).
- If executing via an external proxy/executor, pass per-call credentials (cookies and/or headers) so they are not persisted.

## Dependencies
- Runtime capable of HTTPS requests.
- If using `scripts/api.ts`: TypeScript toolchain (or transpile to JS).

## Endpoints

### Auth Flow (3)
- `GET /cidf/{cidfToken}` — Authenticate and obtain a CIDF token.
- `GET /floors/{floorToken}` — Authenticate and obtain a floor token.
- `POST /webevents/v3/JS/{JSToken}/events` — Send web events with a JS token for authentication.

### Data Read (41)
- `GET /{id}` — Retrieve weather data by ID.
- `GET /{id}/{id}` — Retrieve specific weather data by ID.
- `GET /a/api/fastlane.json` — Retrieve fastlane configuration data.
- `GET /AdServer/js/user_sync.html` — Retrieve user synchronization script.
- `GET /adx/user/sync` — Retrieve user synchronization data.
- `GET /adx/usersyncsupply` — Retrieve user synchronization data.
- `GET /api/{apiId}` — Retrieve weather data using a specific API ID.
- `GET /api/usermatch/index` — Retrieve user match index data.
- `GET /api/v1/dinitsync` — Fetch initial synchronization data.
- `GET /api/v1/dsync/Rubicon` — Retrieve Rubicon data synchronization data.
- `GET /cs/cookiesync/{cookiesyncId}` — Retrieve cookie synchronization status.
- `GET /dis/usersync.aspx` — Retrieve user synchronization data.
- `GET /dsp/api/sync/send` — Send synchronization data to DSP.
- `GET /jwumXNuB/v1/` — Retrieve unspecified data.
- `GET /newsroom/1.0/theweatherchannel/{theweatherchannelId}` — Retrieve newsroom data from The Weather Channel.
- `GET /prebid/setuid` — Retrieve user synchronization data.
- `GET /services/pub` — Retrieve published weather services data.
- `GET /sg/ps/1/cm` — Retrieve unspecified data.
- `GET /sg/thetradedesk-network/1/rtb-h/` — Get weather data from TheTradeDesk network.
- `GET /sid/json` — Retrieve session ID data in JSON format.
- `GET /sy4pW0ak8RGV/MmvGxVZOq_/Zb/mpYEzLuYX1/KzpBLg/FSthbRo-/ASlt` — Get weather data from an unknown source.
- `GET /sync/{syncId}` — Retrieve user synchronization data by ID.
- `GET /t/v2/sync` — Synchronize data.
- `GET /user-sync/{user-syncId}` — Retrieve user synchronization data by ID.
- `GET /usersync/{usersyncId}` — Retrieve user synchronization data by ID.
- `GET /usersync/{usersyncId}/` — Retrieve user synchronization data.
- `GET /usersync/openx/{openxId}` — Retrieve OpenX user synchronization data.
- `GET /usersync/rubicon/MLDXU07D-L-HFBZ` — Retrieve Rubicon user synchronization data.
- `GET /usersync2/rubicon` — Retrieve Rubicon user synchronization data.
- `GET /v1/api/sync/{syncId}` — Get weather data synced by ID.
- `GET /v1/dpusync/6` — Retrieve DPU synchronization data.
- `GET /v1/redirect/{redirectId}` — Retrieve redirect URL.
- `GET /v1/sync/adform/{adformId}` — Retrieve Adform synchronization data.
- `GET /v1/sync/equative/{equativeId}` — Retrieve Equative synchronization data.
- `GET /v1/sync/openx/{openxId}` — Retrieve OpenX synchronization data.
- `GET /v1/sync/pubmatic/{pubmaticId}` — Retrieve Pubmatic synchronization data.
- `GET /v1/sync/sovrn/{sovrnId}` — Get weather data synced from Sovrn by ID.
- `GET /v1/sync/triplelift/{tripleliftId}` — Get weather data synced from Triplelift by ID.
- `GET /v1/syncPage/{syncPageId}` — Retrieve synchronization page data.
- `GET /v2/maps/dynamic` — Retrieve dynamic map data.
- `GET /w/user.sync` — Retrieve user synchronization data.

### Data Write (15)
- `POST /{id}` — Update weather data for a specific ID.
- `POST /{id}/auction` — Update weather data for an auction with a specific ID.
- `POST /{id}/trc/3/json` — Update weather data for TRC with a specific ID.
- `POST /6/map` — Update weather map data.
- `POST /a/api/prebid-exchange.json` — Submit a bid request to a prebid exchange.
- `POST /api/v1/p/redux-dal` — Update weather data using Redux DAL.
- `POST /bid/bidder/weatherchannel` — Submit a bid to the Weather Channel bidder.
- `POST /c/hb/bid` — Submit a bid.
- `POST /e/dtb/bid` — Submit a DTB bid.
- `POST /identity/v1/identify` — Identify a user.
- `POST /openrtb_2_5/pbjs/auction/request` — Submit an OpenRTB 2.5 auction request using PBJS.
- `POST /openrtb/pbjs` — Submit a bid request via OpenRTB using PBJS.
- `POST /OpenRTB/TaboolaHB/auction` — Submit an OpenRTB auction request to TaboolaHB.
- `POST /openrtbb/prebidjs` — Submit a bid request via OpenRTBB using Prebid.js.
- `POST /ut/v3/prebid` — Submit a prebid request.

### Config (1)
- `GET /cdn/prod/config` — Retrieve CDN configuration.

